-- PortfolioMember — a profile's membership in a portfolio. Two
-- EntityRef fields with different phantoms (portfolio + profile).
--
-- Static rows: none. Identity (label / description / icon) is
-- registered by defineSystemEntity on the TS side.
--
-- Phase 3d of the system-entities sweep — see
-- workstreams/ts-elimination/briefs/phase-3d-system-entities-wholesale-flip.md.
-- Two "drop the Id suffix" overrides (portfolioId → "Portfolio",
-- profileId → "Profile") live in the TS-side fieldLabels block.

@entity
@codeName "portfolio_member"
@label "Portfolio Member"
@description "A profile's membership in a portfolio"
@icon "user-plus"
@fieldLabel "portfolioId" "Portfolio"
@fieldLabel "profileId" "Profile"
PortfolioMember = PortfolioMember portfolioId: EntityRef<"portfolio"> profileId: EntityRef<"profile">
